  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC048 detects tracked EF read-modify-write updates that can silently overwrite concurrent changes, while recognizing optimistic concurrency tokens, no-tracking queries, explicit transactions, atomic updates, and conservative same-context boundaries. LC044 hardens local-function lift persistence, async-helper completion, and entry-state modeling; LC046 lifts the helper arity cap and strengthens context-identity proofs; LC047 links Deleted-state dominance to the tested entry.",
